          "guid": "mssxg4gyaxludk4e",
          "message": {
            "text": "Default emoji routing is property-driven across Unicode blocks, but remains cascade-sensitive. Chromium on Linux selected bitmap-only Noto Color Emoji for the Misc Technical, Mahjong and Playing Cards cells; the old hand-maintained ranges omitted these blocks and sent them to the vector path, where they vanished. The color and fill-invariance probes preserve a leading monochrome font while detecting achromatic color-font glyphs.",
            "markdown": "Default emoji routing is property-driven across Unicode blocks, but remains cascade-sensitive. Chromium on Linux selected bitmap-only Noto Color Emoji for the Misc Technical, Mahjong and Playing Cards cells; the old hand-maintained ranges omitted these blocks and sent them to the vector path, where they vanished. The color and fill-invariance probes preserve a leading monochrome font while detecting achromatic color-font glyphs."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/script/emoji-detect.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 318,
                  "endLine": 335,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    // supplementary emoji planes. Misc Technical contains default-emoji\n    // characters such as WATCH, HOURGLASS and the media-control buttons\n    // (U+231A/U+231B/U+23E9..U+23F3). Linux Chromium routes these through\n    // Noto Color Emoji, but the old hand-partitioned ranges left them on the\n    // outline path, where a CBDT-only face has no vector glyph and vanished.\n    // Keep this cascade-sensitive: a leading monochrome face must still win.\n    if (cp >= 0x2300 && cp <= 0x23FF\n        && RE_EMOJI_PRESENTATION.test(String.fromCodePoint(cp))) return isColorGlyph(cp, font);\n    // The Mahjong Tiles and Playing Cards blocks are another gap below the\n    // historical U+1F300 supplementary-plane floor. Chromium paints MAHJONG\n    // TILE RED DRAGON and PLAYING CARD BLACK JOKER from the color font when\n    // that is the resolved cascade face; keep text-font coverage authoritative.\n    if (cp >= 0x1F000 && cp <= 0x1F0FF\n        && RE_EMOJI_PRESENTATION.test(String.fromCodePoint(cp))) return isColorGlyph(cp, font);\n    // U+FE0F (Variation Selector-16) after a base emoji codepoint requests\n    // emoji presentation — Chrome paints the colorful glyph instead of the\n    // text-mode path glyph. DM-278.\n    if (nextCp === 0xFE0F && (emojiBaseCps.has(cp) || emojiPresentation26.has(cp))) return true;"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ],
            "ext-ai-tool-confidence": 0.98
          },
